WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.563
The authors contribute Regularized Adaptive Weight
Modification.

00:00:03.643 --> 00:00:07.206
It has two essential steps.

00:00:07.286 --> 00:00:10.849
First,

00:00:10.929 --> 00:00:14.492
adaptive weight modification introduces an extra
projector that adjusts the update direction

00:00:14.572 --> 00:00:18.135
according to the ratio of classes with similar
feature distribution,

00:00:18.215 --> 00:00:21.778
such as genuine utterances, to the others.

00:00:21.858 --> 00:00:25.421
Second, a regularization term, inspired by learning
without forgetting,

00:00:25.501 --> 00:00:29.064
keeps the new inference distribution close to the old one.

00:00:29.144 --> 00:00:32.707
The method needs no previous samples,

00:00:32.787 --> 00:00:36.350
and the authors show it transfers to speech emotion
recognition and image recognition.
